## 5. Governance

- **Single source of truth.** {{SYSTEM_NAME}} source Figma + this repo. No parallel definitions.
- **Versioned.** Every change lands a changelog entry under the current version; mid-version
  spec corrections append a `patches[]` entry rather than bumping the version.
- **False-gap guard.** Confirm a token/component/pattern doesn't already exist before adding.
- **Generalize, don't special-case.** A new thing must be a reusable pattern, not a one-off.
- **Deprecation has a path.** Nothing is removed without a documented migration.
- **Binding is audited, not assumed.** The binding audit gates every publish — zero unbound.

